### Variáveis de Ambiente
@hostname = localhost
@port = 80
@host = {{hostname}}:{{port}}
@contentType = application/json

### Criar um Novo Utilizador
POST http://{{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "name": "João Silva",
    "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
    "password": "PasswordSegura123"
}

### 2. Login (Obter Token e Set-Cookie)
POST http://{{host}}/api/users/token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
    "password": "PasswordSegura123"
}

### 3. Logout 
POST http://{{host}}/api/users/Logout
Authorization: Bearer "3jUUnOz6ECOSeDIV00X5FdvuOdX9AZjBM4gyZWhoFAI="
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


